              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Seeker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't find this recipe successful. Flavor was okay, but not enough liquid for all those eggs (IMO.) I will try the other recipe on here sometime that calls for 3 cups water instead. Sorry thanks anyway.",
            "datePublished": "2013-03-24T01:37:40.517Z"
          },
          {
