            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Avocat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are beautiful and delicious. The other recipe on the site for these eggs added 3 cups water, so I added some water so the eggs would be more covered. I didn't have Chinese rock sugar, so I put in a little granulated sugar. I should have used black soy sauce instead of regular soy sauce, but they were still good and not too salty at all.",
